{"seq":4,"slug":"cross-modal-generation","title":"跨模态统一生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation/cross-modal-generation","wordCount":1534,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨模态统一生成\">跨模态统一生成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨模态统一生成（Cross-Modal Unified Generation）追求用单一模型同时处理文本、图像、音频、视频和三维等多种模态的理解和生成。这一方向的终极愿景是构建一个&quot;通用生成器&quot;——输入任意模态的条件，输出任意模态的内容。实现这一目标的关键挑战是建立统一的表示空间和生成框架，使得不同模态的数据能够在同一个模型中无缝交互。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[统一多模态模型] --&gt; B[统一 Tokenization]&#10;    A --&gt; C[统一 Transformer]&#10;    A --&gt; D[统一训练目标]&#10;    B --&gt; E[文本 Token]&#10;    B --&gt; F[图像 Token]&#10;    B --&gt; G[音频 Token]&#10;    B --&gt; H[视频 Token]&#10;    C --&gt; I[Any-to-Any 生成]\">graph TD\n    A[统一多模态模型] --&gt; B[统一 Tokenization]\n    A --&gt; C[统一 Transformer]\n    A --&gt; D[统一训练目标]\n    B --&gt; E[文本 Token]\n    B --&gt; F[图像 Token]\n    B --&gt; G[音频 Token]\n    B --&gt; H[视频 Token]\n    C --&gt; I[Any-to-Any 生成]</pre><p>统一生成模型的设计哲学是&quot;一切皆为 Token&quot;——将所有模态的数据都编码为离散或连续的 token 序列，然后在统一的序列模型中学习跨模态的联合分布。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>支持模态</th>\n<th>统一方式</th>\n<th>架构</th>\n<th>核心创新</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CoDi</td>\n<td>文/图/音/视</td>\n<td>对齐隐空间</td>\n<td>多扩散模型</td>\n<td>跨模态注意力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gemini</td>\n<td>文/图/音/视/代码</td>\n<td>原生多模态</td>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n<td>多模态预训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPT-4o</td>\n<td>文/图/音</td>\n<td>统一序列</td>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n<td>端到端语音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chameleon</td>\n<td>文/图</td>\n<td>统一 Token</td>\n<td>Transformer</td>\n<td>混合模态训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Emu3</td>\n<td>文/图/视</td>\n<td>统一 Token</td>\n<td>自回归</td>\n<td>预测下一个 Token</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"统一-token-化策略\">统一 Token 化策略</h2><p>统一 Token 化是实现跨模态生成的基础。不同模态的数据具有截然不同的结构——文本是离散符号序列，图像是二维像素阵列，音频是一维波形信号，视频是三维时空数据。将它们映射到统一的 token 空间需要为每种模态设计合适的编码器，同时确保不同模态的 token 在语义层面可以对齐。</p>\n<p>Chameleon 采用了彻底的统一策略：文本使用 BPE tokenizer，图像使用 VQGAN 编码为离散 token（每张图像 1024 个 token），两种 token 共享同一个词汇表和同一个 Transformer。这种&quot;早期融合&quot;（early fusion）设计使模型从训练开始就学习跨模态的联合分布，理论上能够实现最深层次的模态交互。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class UnifiedTokenizer:&#10;    def __init__(self, text_vocab_size=32000, image_codebook_size=8192, audio_codebook_size=2048):&#10;        self.text_offset = 0&#10;        self.image_offset = text_vocab_size&#10;        self.audio_offset = text_vocab_size + image_codebook_size&#10;        self.total_vocab = text_vocab_size + image_codebook_size + audio_codebook_size&#10;        self.special_tokens = {&#10;            &quot;text_start&quot;: self.total_vocab,&#10;            &quot;image_start&quot;: self.total_vocab + 1,&#10;            &quot;audio_start&quot;: self.total_vocab + 2,&#10;            &quot;modality_end&quot;: self.total_vocab + 3,&#10;        }&#10;&#10;    def encode_text(self, text_tokens):&#10;        return text_tokens + self.text_offset&#10;&#10;    def encode_image(self, image_tokens):&#10;        return image_tokens + self.image_offset&#10;&#10;    def encode_audio(self, audio_tokens):&#10;        return audio_tokens + self.audio_offset&#10;&#10;    def build_sequence(self, modality_tokens_list):&#10;        sequence = []&#10;        for modality, tokens in modality_tokens_list:&#10;            start_token = self.special_tokens[f&quot;{modality}_start&quot;]&#10;            sequence.append(torch.tensor([start_token]))&#10;            sequence.append(tokens)&#10;            sequence.append(torch.tensor([self.special_tokens[&quot;modality_end&quot;]]))&#10;        return torch.cat(sequence)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UnifiedTokenizer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, text_vocab_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, image_codebook_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8192</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, audio_codebook_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2048</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.text_offset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.image_offset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> text_vocab_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.audio_offset </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> text_vocab_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> image_codebook_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.total_vocab </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> text_vocab_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> image_codebook_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> audio_codebook_size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.special_tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"text_start\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.total_vocab,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"image_start\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.total_vocab </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"audio_start\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.total_vocab </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"modality_end\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.total_vocab </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> encode_text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, text_tokens):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> text_tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.text_offset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> encode_image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, image_tokens):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> image_tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.image_offset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> encode_audio</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, audio_tokens):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> audio_tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.audio_offset</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> build_sequence</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, modality_tokens_list):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sequence </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> modality, tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> modality_tokens_list:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            start_token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.special_tokens[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">modality</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">_start\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            sequence.append(torch.tensor([start_token]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            sequence.append(tokens)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            sequence.append(torch.tensor([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.special_tokens[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"modality_end\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cat(sequence)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 统一 Token 化&#10;        T[文本] --&gt; TT[BPE Token 0-31999]&#10;        I[图像] --&gt; IT[VQGAN Token 32000-40191]&#10;        AU[音频] --&gt; AT[EnCodec Token 40192-42239]&#10;        TT --&gt; SEQ[统一序列]&#10;        IT --&gt; SEQ&#10;        AT --&gt; SEQ&#10;        SEQ --&gt; TR[统一 Transformer]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 统一 Token 化\n        T[文本] --&gt; TT[BPE Token 0-31999]\n        I[图像] --&gt; IT[VQGAN Token 32000-40191]\n        AU[音频] --&gt; AT[EnCodec Token 40192-42239]\n        TT --&gt; SEQ[统一序列]\n        IT --&gt; SEQ\n        AT --&gt; SEQ\n        SEQ --&gt; TR[统一 Transformer]\n    end</pre><p>&quot;晚期融合&quot;（late fusion）是另一种策略：不同模态使用独立的编码器和生成器，通过共享的隐空间或交叉注意力实现模态交互。CoDi 采用这种方法，每种模态有独立的扩散模型，通过训练一个跨模态注意力模块将不同模态的隐空间对齐。晚期融合的优势是可以复用现有的单模态模型，劣势是跨模态的交互深度不如早期融合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自回归多模态生成\">自回归多模态生成</h2><p>自回归范式天然适合多模态统一生成——所有模态的 token 序列拼接在一起，模型学习预测&quot;下一个 token&quot;。Emu3 展示了纯自回归模型在多模态生成中的潜力：它将文本、图像和视频统一编码为 token 序列，使用标准的下一个 token 预测目标训练，不需要扩散模型或额外的损失函数。</p>\n<p>多模态自回归的关键挑战是模态间的序列组织方式。交错式（interleaved）排列将不同模态的 token 交替排列，适合生成图文混排内容；前缀式（prefix）将条件模态放在前面、生成模态放在后面，适合条件生成任务。实际系统通常根据任务灵活切换排列方式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class MultiModalTransformer(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, vocab_size, dim=1024, n_heads=16, n_layers=24):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.embedding = nn.Embedding(vocab_size, dim)&#10;        self.pos_embedding = nn.Embedding(8192, dim)&#10;        encoder_layer = nn.TransformerEncoderLayer(&#10;            d_model=dim, nhead=n_heads, dim_feedforward=dim * 4,&#10;            batch_first=True, norm_first=True,&#10;        )&#10;        self.transformer = nn.TransformerEncoder(encoder_layer, n_layers)&#10;        self.output_head = nn.Linear(dim, vocab_size)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, tokens):&#10;        seq_len = tokens.shape[1]&#10;        pos = torch.arange(seq_len, device=tokens.device).unsqueeze(0)&#10;        x = self.embedding(tokens) + self.pos_embedding(pos)&#10;        causal_mask = nn.Transformer.generate_square_subsequent_mask(seq_len, device=tokens.device)&#10;        x = self.transformer(x, mask=causal_mask)&#10;        return self.output_head(x)&#10;&#10;    @torch.no_grad()&#10;    def generate(self, prompt_tokens, max_new_tokens=1024, temperature=1.0):&#10;        tokens = prompt_tokens.clone()&#10;        for _ in range(max_new_tokens):&#10;            logits = self.forward(tokens)[:, -1, :] / temperature&#10;            next_token = torch.multinomial(torch.softmax(logits, dim=-1), 1)&#10;            tokens = torch.cat([tokens, next_token], dim=1)&#10;        return tokens\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MultiModalTransformer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, vocab_size, dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n_heads</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n_layers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.embedding </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Embedding(vocab_size, dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pos_embedding </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Embedding(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8192</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        encoder_layer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.TransformerEncoderLayer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            d_model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dim, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nhead</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_heads, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim_feedforward</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">            batch_first</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">norm_first</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.transformer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.TransformerEncoder(encoder_layer, n_layers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.output_head </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Linear(dim, vocab_size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, tokens):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        seq_len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokens.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        pos </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.arange(seq_len, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokens.device).unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.embedding(tokens) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.pos_embedding(pos)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        causal_mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Transformer.generate_square_subsequent_mask(seq_len, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokens.device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.transformer(x, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mask</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">causal_mask)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.output_head(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @torch.no_grad</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, prompt_tokens, max_new_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prompt_tokens.clone()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(max_new_tokens):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.forward(tokens)[:, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, :] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temperature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            next_token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.multinomial(torch.softmax(logits, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cat([tokens, next_token], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokens</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Gemini 是多模态统一生成的工业界代表。它从预训练阶段就在多模态混合数据上训练，原生支持文本、图像、音频、视频和代码的理解和生成。GPT-4o 则实现了端到端的语音理解和生成，将语音模态完全整合到统一模型中，而非传统的&quot;ASR→LLM→TTS&quot;级联管线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"any-to-any-生成的挑战与前沿\">Any-to-Any 生成的挑战与前沿</h2><p>真正的 Any-to-Any 生成系统需要解决多个开放性挑战。首先是数据问题：不同模态的训练数据规模差异巨大（互联网文本&gt;&gt;图像&gt;视频&gt;音频&gt;三维模型），如何在数据不平衡的情况下实现均衡的多模态能力是核心难题。其次是评估问题：缺乏统一的跨模态评估指标，不同模态的生成质量通常需要独立评估。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>具体问题</th>\n<th>当前解决方案</th>\n<th>未来方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据不平衡</td>\n<td>三维数据极少</td>\n<td>合成数据、迁移学习</td>\n<td>自监督预训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模态对齐</td>\n<td>语义空间不一致</td>\n<td>CLIP 对齐、对比学习</td>\n<td>统一语义空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算成本</td>\n<td>多模态数据量大</td>\n<td>模型稀疏化、MoE</td>\n<td>高效架构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量一致性</td>\n<td>不同模态质量不均</td>\n<td>多阶段训练</td>\n<td>统一优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评估指标</td>\n<td>无统一跨模态指标</td>\n<td>各模态独立评估</td>\n<td>统一评估框架</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Mixture of Experts（MoE）是一种有希望的方法来应对计算效率挑战。通过将模型参数分为共享专家和模态特定专家，MoE 可以在不成比例增加计算量的情况下扩大模型容量。不同模态的输入激活不同的专家子集，实现了参数效率和模态特化的平衡。</p>\n<p>世界模型（World Model）是 Any-to-Any 生成的更远期愿景。它不仅生成多模态内容，还需要理解物理规律、因果关系和时空一致性。Sora 被 OpenAI 定位为&quot;世界模拟器&quot;，体现了从内容生成到世界建模的方向性转变。实现这一愿景需要模型具备物理推理、长程规划和因果理解等深层能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((跨模态统一))&#10;    Token 化策略&#10;      早期融合&#10;      晚期融合&#10;      统一词汇表&#10;    生成范式&#10;      自回归&#10;      扩散&#10;      混合&#10;    代表模型&#10;      Chameleon&#10;      Emu3&#10;      Gemini&#10;    前沿挑战&#10;      数据不平衡&#10;      模态对齐&#10;      世界模型\">mindmap\n  root((跨模态统一))\n    Token 化策略\n      早期融合\n      晚期融合\n      统一词汇表\n    生成范式\n      自回归\n      扩散\n      混合\n    代表模型\n      Chameleon\n      Emu3\n      Gemini\n    前沿挑战\n      数据不平衡\n      模态对齐\n      世界模型</pre><ul>\n<li>统一 Token 化是跨模态生成的基础，早期融合和晚期融合各有优劣</li>\n<li>自回归范式通过&quot;预测下一个 Token&quot;自然地支持多模态统一生成</li>\n<li>Chameleon 和 Emu3 展示了纯自回归多模态模型的可行性</li>\n<li>数据不平衡、模态对齐和计算效率是 Any-to-Any 生成的核心挑战</li>\n<li>世界模型是多模态生成的远期愿景，需要物理推理和因果理解能力</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨模态统一生成","id":"跨模态统一生成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"统一 Token 化策略","id":"统一-token-化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"自回归多模态生成","id":"自回归多模态生成"},{"level":2,"text":"Any-to-Any 生成的挑战与前沿","id":"any-to-any-生成的挑战与前沿"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"文本到三维生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/multimodal-generation/text-to-3d"},"next":{"title":"创意 AI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/aigc-applications/creative-ai"}}